stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DataIngestion
    DataIngestion --> Preprocessing: Load CSV files
    Preprocessing --> FeatureEngineering: Extract 9 audio features
    FeatureEngineering --> Normalization: StandardScaler
    Normalization --> IndexBuilding: BallTree construction

    IndexBuilding --> Ready: Index cached in memory

    Ready --> UserQuery: Track selection
    UserQuery --> NearestNeighborSearch: BallTree.query(k=6)
    NearestNeighborSearch --> HybridScoring: Similarity + Popularity
    HybridScoring --> Ranking: Sort by score
    Ranking --> Results: Top 5 recommendations
    Results --> Display: UI with Spotify embeds

    Display --> [*]

    note right of IndexBuilding
        One-time operation
        ~4,831 tracks indexed
        O(n log n) build time
    end note

    note right of NearestNeighborSearch
        O(log n) query time
        ~0.004s average
        Returns distances + indices
    end note

    note right of HybridScoring
        Score = 0.7 × similarity + 0.3 × popularity
        Similarity = 1 / (1 + distance)
        Popularity = track_popularity / 100
    end note